Package: gcanvas
Type: Package
Title: Genomic Visualization and Analysis Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Beomsu", family = "Kim",
    email = "bk.statg@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7410-4273"))
Description: A toolkit for visualizing and analyzing genomic association data,
    including Manhattan, Q-Q, regional, Miami, circos, and heterozygosity-
    missingness plots; principal component analysis with reference projection
    and ancestry estimation; LD computation, clumping, and proxy lookup;
    GTF-driven gene/exon tracks; liftover; and assorted helpers for working
    with GWAS summary statistics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/stat-gene/gcanvas
